# Digests of the vendored test vectors.
#
# The suite's authority comes entirely from these files being what upstream
# published. Nothing else pins them: the case lockfiles record names and
# feature tags, so editing a `result` or a `tag` inside a vector to match a
# buggy implementation produces no lockfile diff and a green run. That is
# the one edit this suite cannot otherwise detect, and it is the one an
# implementer under deadline pressure is most tempted by.
#
# `just verify-vectors` (part of `just conformance`) checks these. Changing
# a vector therefore has to change this file too, which makes it a
# reviewable line in a diff rather than an invisible one.
#
# Regenerate deliberately, after establishing that the new bytes are
# upstream's: `just update-vector-digests`.
